   258	 *   { ok:false, kind:'malformed', reason:HEAL_INPUT_INVALID, detail }
   259	 *   { ok:false, kind:'usage', detail }                      —— --step 指了不存在的步
   260	 *   { ok:false, kind:'case', reason, detail }               —— 案级互证失配
